opper)]/15 transition-colors duration-300\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield w-4 h-4 md:w-5 md:h-5 text-[var(--color-copper)]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-[var(--color-ink)] mb-2\">Consistent Quality</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-[var(--color-ink)]/45 leading-relaxed\">Rigorous quality checks at every production stage.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"tilt-card rounded-2xl\" style=\"transition:transform 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1), box-shadow 0.5s ease\"><div class=\"relative p-7 rounded-2xl card-light overflow-hidden h-full\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px);transition:all 0.6s ease 0.42000000000000004s\"><div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-32 h-32 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_top_right,rgba(74,93,78,0.06),transparent)]\"></div><div class=\"relative z-10\"><div class=\"w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-[var(--color-copper)]/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-5 group-hover:bg-[var(--color-copper)]/15 transition-colors duration-300\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-truck w-4 h-4 md:w-5 md:h-5 text-[var(--color-copper)]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 18V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v11a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h2\"></path><path d=\"M15 18H9\"></path><path d=\"M19 18h2a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-3.65a1 1 0 0 0-.22-.624l-3.48-4.35A1 1 0 0 0 17.52 8H14\"></path><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\"></circle><circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-[var(--color-ink)] mb-2\">Pan India Delivery</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-[var(--color-ink)]/45 leading-relaxed\">Reliable logistics ensuring timely delivery nationwide.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"tilt-card rounded-2xl\" style=\"transition:transform 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1), box-shadow 0.5s ease\"><div class=\"relative p-7 rounded-2xl card-light overflow-hidden h-full\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px);transition:all 0.6s ease 0.5s\"><div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-32 h-32 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_top_right,rgba(74,93,78,0.06),transparent)]\"></div><div class=\"relative z-10\"><div class=\"w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-[var(--color-copper)]/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-5 group-hover:bg-[var(--color-copper)]/15 transition-colors duration-300\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-headphones w-4 h-4 md:w-5 md:h-5 text-[var(--color-copper)]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 14h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-7a9 9 0 0 1 18 0v7a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-1a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-3a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-[var(--color-ink)] mb-2\">Dedicated Support</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-[var(--color-ink)]/45 leading-relaxed\">Personal account managers for seamless communication.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"products\" class=\"relative py-28\" style=\"background:var(--color-cream)\"><div class=\"section-line-light mb-20\"></div><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6\"><div class=\"text-center mb-14\"><span class=\"inline-block text-[11px] tracking-[0.15em] text-[var(--color-copper)] uppercase mb-5\" style=\"opacity:0;transition:all 0.5s ease\">Our Work</span><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-[2.75rem] font-bold mb-5 text-[var(--color-ink)]\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(15px);transition:all 0.6s ease 0.1s\">Crafted for <span class=\"copper-text\">leading brands</span>.</h2><p class=\"text-[var(--color-ink)]/40 max-w-lg mx-auto\" style=\"opacity:0;transition:all 0.6s ease 0.2s\">Auto-scrolling showcase. Drag to explore.</p></div><div class=\"w-full\" style=\"opacity:0;transition:all 0.8s ease 0.3s\"><div style=\"width:100%;height:380px;min-height:380px\"></div></div></div></section><section id=\"about\" class=\"relative py-28\" style=\"background:var(--color-cream)\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6\"><div class=\"grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-20 items-center\"><div><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-[2.75rem] font-bold leading-tight mb-7 text-[var(--color-ink)]\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(15px);transition:all 0.6s ease 0.1s\">Built for brands that care about <span class=\"copper-text\">every detail</span>.</h2><p class=\"text-[var(--color-ink)]/60 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-5\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(15px);transition:all 0.6s ease 0.2s\">TagX began with a simple vision: provide apparel brands with premium trims that elevate every product presentation.</p><p class=\"text-[var(--color-ink)]/40 leading-relaxed mb-8\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(15px);transition:all 0.6s ease 0.25s\">Every product — Hang Tags, Woven Labels, Satin Labels — is manufactured under one roof in Ahmedabad, Gujarat. We serve apparel brands, garment manufacturers, wholesalers, exporters, and startup fashion labels across India.</p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-6\" style=\"opacity:0;transition:all 0.6s ease 0.3s\"><a href=\"#contact\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--color-cream)] copper-grad rounded-full hover:shadow-[0_0_25px_rgba(74,93,78,0.3)] duration-300\" style=\"transition:transform 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);display:inline-flex\">Start a Conversation</a><a href=\"#products\" class=\"text-sm text-[var(--color-copper)] hover:text-[var(--color-copper-light)] transition-colors group inline-flex items-center gap-1 font-medium\">View Our Work<span class=\"transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1\">→</span></a></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center justify-center\" style=\"perspective:800px;opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px);transition:all 0.7s ease 0.3s\"><div style=\"transform:rotateY(-14deg) rotateX(8deg) translateZ(50px);transform-style:preserve-3d\"><img src=\"/tag1.jpeg\" alt=\"TagX Hang Tag\" class=\"w-[22rem] md:w-[36rem] h-[30rem] md:h-[42rem] object-contain\" style=\"filter:drop-shadow(20px 25px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.4)) drop-shadow(8px 12px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.3)) drop-shadow(0px 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.2))\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"testimonials\" class=\"relative py-24 md:py-28\" style=\"background:var(--color-cream-dark)\"><div class=\"section-line-light mb-16\"></div><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-5 md:px-6\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\"><span class=\"inline-block text-[11px] tracking-[0.15em] text-[var(--color-copper)] uppercase mb-5\" style=\"opacity:0;transition:all 0.5s ease\">Testimonials</span><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-[2.75rem] font-bold text-[var(--color-ink)]\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(15px);transition:all 0.6s ease 0.1s\">Trusted by <span class=\"copper-text\">brands</span>.</h2></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6\"><div class=\"tilt-card rounded-2xl\" style=\"transition:transform 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1), box-shadow 0.5s ease\"><div class=\"p-7 rounded-2xl card-light\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px);transition:all 0.6s ease 0.1s\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-quote w-8 h-8 text-[var(--color-copper)]/20 mb-4 transition-colors duration-300\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 3a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2 1 1 0 0 1 1 1v1a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 1 1 0 0 0-1 1v2a1 1 0 0 0 1 1 6 6 0 0 0 6-6V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z\"></path><path d=\"M5 3a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2 1 1 0 0 1 1 1v1a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 1 1 0 0 0-1 1v2a1 1 0 0 0 1 1 6 6 0 0 0 6-6V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-[var(--color-ink)]/60 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6 italic\">“<!-- -->Clear communication from quote to delivery. The hang tags elevated our entire product presentation. TagX understands premium branding.<!-- -->”</p><div><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--color-ink)]\">Chandan Singh</p><p class=\"text-xs text-[var(--color-ink)]/40\">Founder<!-- -->, <!-- -->Maharaja Creation</p></div></div></div><div class=\"tilt-card rounded-2xl\" style=\"transition:transform 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1), box-shadow 0.5s ease\"><div class=\"p-7 rounded-2xl card-light\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px);transition:all 0.6s ease 0.2s\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-quote w-8 h-8 text-[var(--color-copper)]/20 mb-4 transition-colors duration-300\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 3a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2 1 1 0 0 1 1 1v1a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 1 1 0 0 0-1 1v2a1 1 0 0 0 1 1 6 6 0 0 0 6-6V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z\"></path><path d=\"M5 3a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2 1 1 0 0 1 1 1v1a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 1 1 0 0 0-1 1v2a1 1 0 0 0 1 1 6 6 0 0 0 6-6V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-[var(--color-ink)]/60 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6 italic\">“<!-- -->TagX has become our go-to for all trims. The woven labels are consistently perfect — high density, crisp detail, every time.<!-- -->”</p><div><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--color-ink)]\">Nirmal Kumar</p><p class=\"text-xs text-[var(--color-ink)]/40\">Managing Director<!-- -->, <!-- -->Saratha Export</p></div></div></div><div class=\"tilt-card rounded-2xl\" style=\"transition:transform 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1), box-shadow 0.5s ease\"><div class=\"p-7 rounded-2xl card-light\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px);transition:all 0.6s ease 0.30000000000000004s\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-quote w-8 h-8 text-[var(--color-copper)]/20 mb-4 transition-colors duration-300\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 3a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2 1 1 0 0 1 1 1v1a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 1 1 0 0 0-1 1v2a1 1 0 0 0 1 1 6 6 0 0 0 6-6V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z\"></path><path d=\"M5 3a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2 1 1 0 0 1 1 1v1a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 1 1 0 0 0-1 1v2a1 1 0 0 0 1 1 6 6 0 0 0 6-6V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-[var(--color-ink)]/60 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6 italic\">“<!-- -->PU labels held up perfectly through wash testing. The quality and durability are exactly what our activewear line demanded.<!-- -->”</p><div><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--color-ink)]\">Samved</p><p class=\"text-xs text-[var(--color-ink)]/40\">Operations Head<!-- -->, <!-- -->Adinath Exports</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"contact\" class=\"relative py-28 overflow-hidden\" style=\"background:var(--color-cream)\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 overflow-hidden pointer-events-none\" style=\"--dot-color:#4A5D4E;--mx:-9999px;--my:-9999px\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0\" style=\"background-image:radial-gradient(circle, var(--dot-color) 1.5px, transparent 1.5px);background-size:32px 32px;opacity:0.12\"></div><div class=\"absolute rounded-full pointer-events-none\" style=\"width:200px;height:200px;background:radial-gradient(circle, var(--dot-color), transparent 70%);left:var(--mx);top:var(--my);transform:translate(-50%, -50%);opacity:0.12;transition:opacity 0.3s\"></div><